[run_fivebench] --union_mask_dir and --blend_sched are mutually exclusive: the R20 schedule overrides the per-step scalar rate the spatial field is built on, so combining them would silently discard one of the two.
[run_fivebench] --tau_bg/--tau_fg require --union_mask_dir: without the mask there is no field to build, and the taus would be accepted and then silently ignored.
